{
  "about": [
    "One adversarial table for template text (editable words, live numbers) in a managed site, run by",
    "site-starter packages/managed-site-contract (src/text-template.ts, the rule Site Guard and a site build hold a value to)",
    "and by megaseo-web's CMS (the SQL writer's judge and its TypeScript twin cms_text_rules.ts).",
    "Keep this file byte-identical wherever it is run; change every copy together.",
    "templates: constraints.template declarations a valueCase or renderCase names.",
    "valueCases: a plain_text value under its template, limits minLength 1, maxLength 60, newlines forbid unless the case states limits.",
    "expected.reason is the CMS's refusal reason, in cmsTextRefusal's order: line_break; then for each placeholder in declared order, placeholder_missing or placeholder_repeated; then stray_brace; then too_long; then too_short. The contract package is held to outcome only.",
    "renderCases: contract-only; each expected rendering is stable across CLDR versions (a separator CLDR has changed, such as de-CH's apostrophe, is not pinned here); renderManagedTextTemplateV1(template, text, inputs), and whether its inverse matchManagedTextTemplateV1 reads the inputs back (match false: the rendered text is ambiguous and reads as no match)."
  ],
  "defaultLimits": {
    "minLength": 1,
    "maxLength": 60,
    "newlines": "forbid"
  },
  "templates": {
    "count": {
      "locale": "en",
      "placeholders": [
        {
          "name": "count",
          "minimumIntegerDigits": 1,
          "grouping": false
        }
      ],
      "plural": null
    },
    "count_one": {
      "locale": "en",
      "placeholders": [
        {
          "name": "count",
          "minimumIntegerDigits": 1,
          "grouping": false
        }
      ],
      "plural": {
        "placeholder": "count",
        "category": "one"
      }
    },
    "count_other": {
      "locale": "en",
      "placeholders": [
        {
          "name": "count",
          "minimumIntegerDigits": 1,
          "grouping": false
        }
      ],
      "plural": {
        "placeholder": "count",
        "category": "other"
      }
    },
    "two": {
      "locale": "en",
      "placeholders": [
        {
          "name": "count",
          "minimumIntegerDigits": 1,
          "grouping": false
        },
        {
          "name": "total",
          "minimumIntegerDigits": 1,
          "grouping": false
        }
      ],
      "plural": null
    },
    "step": {
      "locale": "en",
      "placeholders": [
        {
          "name": "step",
          "minimumIntegerDigits": 2,
          "grouping": false
        }
      ],
      "plural": null
    },
    "grouped": {
      "locale": "en",
      "placeholders": [
        {
          "name": "count",
          "minimumIntegerDigits": 1,
          "grouping": true
        }
      ],
      "plural": null
    },
    "grouped2": {
      "locale": "en",
      "placeholders": [
        {
          "name": "count",
          "minimumIntegerDigits": 1,
          "grouping": true
        },
        {
          "name": "total",
          "minimumIntegerDigits": 1,
          "grouping": false
        }
      ],
      "plural": null
    },
    "padded3": {
      "locale": "en",
      "placeholders": [
        {
          "name": "count",
          "minimumIntegerDigits": 3,
          "grouping": false
        }
      ],
      "plural": null
    },
    "padgroup": {
      "locale": "en",
      "placeholders": [
        {
          "name": "count",
          "minimumIntegerDigits": 8,
          "grouping": true
        }
      ],
      "plural": null
    },
    "hi": {
      "locale": "hi",
      "placeholders": [
        {
          "name": "count",
          "minimumIntegerDigits": 1,
          "grouping": true
        }
      ],
      "plural": null
    }
  },
